Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:42.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星际迷航8：第一类接触》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢丘塔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locutus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是博格的卢丘塔斯 反抗是没有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Locutus of Borg. Resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,授权 皮卡特4-7-α-T\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorization, Picard 4-7-alpha-tango.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.43,0:04:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上将 - 打扰到你了吗 吉恩·卢克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Admiral. - Catch you at a bad time, Jean-Luc?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从深空5号接到一个令人不安的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just received a disturbing report from Deep Space Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在艾佛星上的殖民地今天上午被摧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our colony on Ivor Prime was destroyed this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 远程传感器探测到… - 是的 我知道 博格人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Long-range sensors have picked up… - Yes, I know. The Borg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长日志 星历 50893.5\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain's Log, Stardate 50893.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心了近六年的时刻终于来临了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment I have dreaded for nearly six years has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:05:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的死敌 博格人 开始入侵联邦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg, our most lethal enemy, have begun an invasion of the Federation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次 可能没有人能拦得住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this time, there may be no stopping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多少艘船？- 一艘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many ships? - One.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接冲着地球开过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's on a direct course for Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时之内就会进入联邦区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will cross the Federation border in less than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,海耶斯上将在台风区部署了一支舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Hayes is mobilizing a fleet in the Typhon sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以最快的速度 只要3小时25分钟就能到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At maximum warp, it will take us three hours, 25 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不去 - 我们不去是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not going. - What do you mean, we're not going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务是在中立区巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our orders are to patrol the Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防止罗姆卢斯人会趁机入侵.\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case the Romulans decide to take advantage of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗姆卢斯人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Romulans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 在过去的九个月以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, there has been no unusual activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗姆卢斯边境没有什么异常的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}along the Romulan border for the last nine months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不可能在这个时候挑起冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems highly unlikely they would choose this moment to start a conflict,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰队是不是觉得我们应该继续适航？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Starfleet feel we need more shakedown time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我们在太空里待了近一年了 我们能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, we've been out in space nearly a year now. We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业E号是舰队里最先进的星际舰船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Enterprise-E is the most advanced starship in the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该上前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be on the frontline.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些我都跟舰队指挥部说过了 他们的命令照旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have gone over all this with Starfleet Command. Their orders stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:06:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大副 设定航线前往中立区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number One, set a course for the Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比才？- 是柏辽兹 有什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bizet? - Berlioz. What do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经完成了中立区的第一遍扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}We finished our first sensor sweep of the Neutral Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,每立方米有20颗太空尘粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty particles of space dust per cubic meter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,紫外线辐射反应52次 2级彗星一颗\N{\fnArial\fs30}fifty-two ultraviolet radiation spikes and a class-2 comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些情况确实值得关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is certainly worthy of our attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我们为什么要在这追彗星呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, why are we out here chasing comets?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧 舰队对企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say that Starfleet has every confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和它的船员是非常有信心的 他们只是信不过它的船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the Enterprise and her crew. They're just not sure about her captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为一个曾经被博格人俘虏并同化的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They believe that a man who was once captured and assimilated by the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该再一次跟他们碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}should not be put in a situation where he would face them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这样做 就会在关键时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do so would introduce an unstable element.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,增添不稳定因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a critical situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是可笑 正因为如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ridiculous. Your experience with the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是指挥作战的最佳人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes you the perfect man to lead this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,海耶斯上将不这么想.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Hayes disagrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舰桥呼叫皮卡特船长 - 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bridge to Captain Picard. - Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚收到舰队传来的消息 他们和博格人开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've just received word from the fleet. They've engaged the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据先生 调到舰队的频率 1486\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Data, put Starfleet frequency 1-4-8-6 on audio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.51,0:07:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,旗舰呼叫进取号 请在A-15区待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flagship to Endeavor, stand by to engage at grid A-15.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入战位 挑战号和波兹曼号退到一号位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defiant and Bozeman, fall back to mobile position one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:08:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格方块已经进入可视范围 航线0-215 速度 曲翘九点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have it in visual range. A Borg cube on course 0 mark 2-1-5, speed warp…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是博格人 放下护盾投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Borg. Lower your shields and surrender your ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会吸纳你们生物和技术优越性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will add your biological and technological distinctiveness to our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的文明将会为我们服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your culture will adapt to service us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗是没有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.49,0:08:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位开火 重新调整护盾…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, open fire. Remodulate shield…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经攻破了防线…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've broken through the defense perimeter…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.33,0:08:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲地球去了 追踪航线…\N{\fnArial\fs30}toward Earth. Pursuit course…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格方块已经改变航线了 021-4\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cube is changing course. 0-2-1 mark 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战号 继续攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defiant, continue to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,旗舰呼叫舰队指挥部 请增援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flagship to Starfleet Command. We need reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤亡报告…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casualty report is coming in…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来克星敦号旗舰上死亡96人 受伤22人\N{\fnArial\fs30}96 dead, 22 wounded on the Lexington.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍克上尉 设定航线 前往地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Hawk, set a course for Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 最大曲翘速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye, sir. - Maximum warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算直接违抗上级的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to commit a direct violation of our orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人反对 请现在说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of you who wish to object should do so now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记到船长日志里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be noted in my log.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我想我可以代表大家说一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I believe I speak for everyone here, sir, when I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让命令见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hell with our orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色警报！所有人员准备战斗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red alert! All hands to battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报告情况！- 主动力失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Report! - Main power is off-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经失去了护盾 武器也用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost shields and our weapons are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许今天是升天的好日子 全速撞击敌舰！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps today is a good day to die. Prepare for ramming speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 又来了一艘星舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there's another starship coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战号快不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Defiant's losing life support.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三传送室 把上面的生还者传送过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge to Transporter Room 3. Beam the Defiant survivors aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 上将的舰船被摧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, the Admiral's ship has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格方块的情况怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the status of the Borg cube?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的外壳已经受到了重创\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has sustained heavy damage to its outer hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但仪表显示 它还有动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am reading fluctuations in their power grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏幕显像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onscreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大副 接通舰队的通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number One, open a channel to the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,接通了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Channel open, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:11:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是企业号的皮卡特船长 现在由我接管舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Captain Picard of the Enterprise. I'm taking command of the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们所有的武器 瞄准以下坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target all of your weapons onto the following coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一下令就开火 - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire on my command. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些坐标看上去不像是要害部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coordinates you have indicated do not appear to be a vital system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰队有回应了 他们在待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fleet's responded, sir. They're standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍克 立刻追击 出发 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Hawk, pursuit course. Engage. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个病人坚持要到舰桥上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a patient here who insists on coming to the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临企业E号 沃尔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard the Enterprise-E, Mr. Worf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挑战号呢？- 还可以打捞回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Defiant? - Adrift but salvageable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 结实的小船 - 小船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tough little ship. - Little?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫先生 你可以帮忙作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, we could use some help at tactical.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得怎么用死光枪吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do remember how to fire phasers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,传感器显示它正在发出时间粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensors show chronometric particles emanating from the sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在制造时光旋涡 - 时光隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're creating a temporal vortex. - Time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被卷入了时光旋涡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We appear to be caught in a temporal wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain. Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大气里含有高浓度的甲烷\N{\fnArial\fs30}The atmosphere contains high concentrations of methane,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一氧化碳和氟\N{\fnArial\fs30}carbon monoxide and fluorine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有生命迹象吗？- 有生命迹象 人口大概是90亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Life-signs? - Population, approximately 9 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是博格人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Borg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么会？- 他们肯定是回到了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - They must've done it in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把地球同化了 改变了历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went back and assimilated Earth, changed history.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们改变了历史 我们怎么还在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if they changed history, why are we still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是时光旋涡使我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The temporal wake must have somehow protected us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有受到时间改变的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the changes in the timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 旋涡在减弱 - 保持航线 霍克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, the vortex is collapsing. - Hold your course, Mr. Hawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得跟着回去 补救他们造成的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must follow them back, repair whatever damage they've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 晚安 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Good night, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你就会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna regret this tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我这么久了 你应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the things you should have learned about me by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that I don't have regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 莉莉 再喝一杯 - 喂 喂 你喝得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Lily. One more round. - Z. Z, you had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想跟喝醉的飞行员上天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going up in that thing with a drunken pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是清醒的话就不敢上天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure as hell am not going up there sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个就是狮子座\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the constellation Leo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是东联！- 这么多年又回来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's an ECON! - After all these years?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快去凤凰号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get to the Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的凤凰号吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hell with the Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命！救命！- 快！快跑！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! Help! - Hurry! Move out! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.97,0:15:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边儿！泽弗兰！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! Zefram!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.53,0:15:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,护盾和远程传感器失灵 主动力还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shields are down, long-range sensors are off-line, main power's holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据天体测量结果 现在是21世纪中期\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to our astrometric readings, we are in the mid-21st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.66,0:15:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,从大气里的放射性同位素来看 我推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the radioactive isotopes in the atmosphere, I would estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是第三次世界大战之后大概十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have arrived approximately 10 years after the Third World War.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理 很多大城市都被摧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense. Most of the major cities have been destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下极少政府 已经有6亿人丧生\N{\fnArial\fs30}very few governments left, 600 million dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毫无反抗力 - 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No resistance. - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫先生 准备量子鱼雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, quantum torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了 长官 - 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready, sir. - Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在冲地面开火 方位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were firing at the surface. Location?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,西半球 北美大陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Western hemisphere, North American continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是蒙大拿中部的一个发射基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a missile complex in central Montana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missile complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,日期呢 数据 告诉我确切的日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}The date. Data, I need to know the exact date.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是 2063年4月4日\N{\fnArial\fs30}April 4th, 2063.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 4月4日 第一次接触的前一天 - 是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- April 4th, the day before first contact. - Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:16:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这导弹基地肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the missile complex must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:17:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽弗兰·科克伦建造曲翘飞船的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Zefram Cochrane is building his warp ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来这儿就是为了阻止第一次接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they came here to do, stop first contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么损坏 上尉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much damage, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不清楚 远程传感器还没法用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't tell. Long- range sensors are still off-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得下去看看情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go down there, find out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 贝弗利 你们跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, Beverly, you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫战斗小组到3号传送室见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a security team meet us in Transporter Room 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑 准备21世纪的便服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, mid-21st century civilian clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大副 你守住舰桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number One, you have the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:17:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看里面有没有科克伦 数据 我们去检查曲翘飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if one of them is Cochrane. Data, let's go check the warp ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来飞船的整体结构没有受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}The structural integrity of the missile appears to be intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过机身多个部位和中间冷却器主系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there is significant damage to various sections of the fuselage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,受损很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}and primary intercooler system.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号的电脑上应该有最初的设计图\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have the original blueprints in the Enterprise computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,得叫拉弗吉中校带一队人下来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander La Forge will need to bring a team down here…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开枪！我们是来帮你的！- 胡说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold your fire! We're here to help you! - Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我想我能去应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I believe I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 这个人需要接受治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, this woman requires medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,θ射线严重中毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Severe theta radiation poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是受损的节流阀发出的辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radiation is coming from the damaged throttle assembly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都得打预防针\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna have to be inoculated,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得带她回医务室 - 医生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I have to get her to Sickbay. - Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.43,0:19:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别跟我说什么规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no lectures about the Prime Directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让她一直昏迷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will keep her unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.89,0:19:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 叫瑞克中校带一个搜索队下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. Tell Commander Riker to beam down with a search party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到科克伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find Cochrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉什呼叫企业号 两名人员直接前往医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crusher to Enterprise, two to beam directly to Sickbay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,离飞船发射还有不到14个钟头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have less than 14 hours before this ship has to be launched.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皮卡特呼叫工程部 - 我是拉弗吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Picard to Engineering. - La Forge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐迪 科克伦的飞船受到了损坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geordi, Cochrane's ship was damaged in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带工程人员下来 有活要做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down here with an engineering detail. We have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我就来 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I'm on my way, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.09,0:20:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,A队去3号传送室集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha team, let's assemble in Transporter Room 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要到地面上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're heading down to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特 我回来之前由你负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porter, you're gonna be in command till I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.39,0:20:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 还有 波特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye, sir. - And, Porter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走之后检查一下环境控制系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}check out the environmental controls while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点太热了 好了 出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting a little warm in here. All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是个不错的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a good spot right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.99,0:20:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇妙吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘飞船原来是枚核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ship used to be a nuclear missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克伦博士选择大规模杀伤性武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is an historical irony.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来开创和平纪元\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Dr. Cochrane would choose an instrument of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有讽刺意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}to inaugurate an era of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我从小的梦想 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a boyhood fantasy, Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在史密森学会见过这艘飞船不下百次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must've seen this ship hundreds of times in the Smithsonian,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可从没触摸过它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was never able to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这种触摸会改变您对凤凰号的认知吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, does tactile contact alter your perception of the Phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对人类来说 经过触摸 你跟某件物体的联系会变得更密切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For humans, touch can connect you to an object in a very personal way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会更真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}make it seem more real.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我只感觉到钛外壳有缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am detecting imperfections in the titanium casing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃油汽管的温度变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}temperature variations in the fuel manifold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经过触摸 并没有比刚才变得更真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is no more real to me now than it was a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:22:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是打扰你们了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you three like to be alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.23,0:22:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.44,0:22:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个基地都找不到科克伦的踪影\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sign of Cochrane anywhere in the complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘飞船对他来说非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing more important to him than this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次飞行是他的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}This flight, it was his dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 科克伦博士可能已经在基地的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, we should consider the possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭遇袭击丧生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Dr. Cochrane was killed in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.08,0:22:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真这样 那人类的未来也就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's true, then the future may die with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来整个环境系统都失常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the entire environmental system's gone crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.81,0:22:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是工程室 这一层都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just Engineering. It's the entire deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.40,0:22:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是调节管道出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a problem with the EPS conduits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.53,0:22:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！- 你在跟我说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Are you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别人在这儿进行维修吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anyone else working maintenance in this section?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.64,0:23:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗？你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul? Are you okay in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长？怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡特呼叫企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picard to Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫 船上一切正常吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, is everything all right up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.42,0:23:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 16层的环境控制系统出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. We are experiencing some environmental difficulties on Deck 16,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.51,0:23:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.68,0:23:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么样的问题？- 在过去的一个小时内湿度上升了73%\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of difficulties? - Humidity levels have risen 73%.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:24:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,温度上到了10度\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the temperature has jumped 10 degrees in the last hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和数据马上就回去 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Data and I are returning to the ship. - Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大副 你负责这里 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Number One, take charge down here. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.03,0:24:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,细胞膜的损伤已经修复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damage to her cell membranes is repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.03,0:24:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should be fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.07,0:24:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再查一下她的脊柱组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'd like to run another test on her spinal tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.86,0:24:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再查查为什么这么热\N{\fnArial\fs30}And find out why it's so hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.08,0:24:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉什呼叫工程部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crusher to Engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.33,0:24:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉什呼叫舰桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crusher to Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫中校 告诉我到底发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Worf, I need to know exactly what's been happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚和16层失去了联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just lost contact with Deck 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.51,0:24:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯 内部传感器 一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Communications, internal sensors, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要调派安全小组过去调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to send a security team to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.18,0:24:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！封锁16层\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Seal off Deck 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.05,0:24:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人守住所有入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Post security teams at every access point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.85,0:24:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 霍克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye, sir. - Mr. Hawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.39,0:24:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,传感器失灵之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we lost internal sensors,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程室里是什么样的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}what were the exact environmental conditions in Main Engineering?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.35,0:24:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,气压比正常值高出2000帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atmospheric pressure was two kilopascals above normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.73,0:24:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,湿度为92% 摄氏39.1度\N{\fnArial\fs30}ninety-two percent humidity, 39.1 degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.65,0:24:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄氏39.1度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty-nine-point-one degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.70,0:24:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像博格人的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a Borg ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.78,0:24:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道他们的飞船会被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew their ship was doomed. Our shields were down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.12,0:25:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就趁我们护盾失效的时候潜入进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow they transported over here without being detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.33,0:25:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会同化企业号再同化地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll assimilate the Enterprise, and then Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.25,0:25:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picard to Riker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,特遣队请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enterprise to away team.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.72,0:25:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.85,0:25:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 主控系统被改接进了工程室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, main control is being rerouted through Main Engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器 护盾 推进力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons, shields, propulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.19,0:25:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 马上锁住主电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly, Mr. Data! Lock out the main computer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.82,0:25:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经用不规则的碎片密码锁住了主电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have isolated the main computer with a fractal encryption code.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.37,0:25:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人不太可能破解这个密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is highly unlikely the Borg will be able to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人切断了16层之外所有层的主动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg have cut primary power to all decks except 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.79,0:25:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人不会留在16层\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg won't stay on Deck 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.34,0:25:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 你没事了 醒醒 快点儿 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. You're all right. Come on. Come on. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.05,0:26:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 冷静 你没事的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Stay calm. You are all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.81,0:26:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen to me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 照我的话做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna be fine. I need you to do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.23,0:26:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿丽赛雅 全息程序还可以用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alyssa, is the EMH program still online?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.85,0:26:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该可以 - 对 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It should be. - That's it. That's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.44,0:26:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没有用过这东西 电脑 启动全息程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore I'd never use one of these. Computer, activate the EMH program.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.40,0:26:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说明需要什么服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please state the nature of the medical emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人马上就要冲进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty Borg are about to break through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.57,0:26:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去分散他们的注意力 让我们离开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need time to get out of here. Create a diversion!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.49,0:26:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程序没这功能 我是医生 不是门栓\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't part of my program. I'm a doctor, not a doorstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.67,0:26:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳个舞 讲个故事 随你便 只要给我们几秒钟时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do a dance, tell a story. I don't care. Just give us a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.05,0:26:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队的医疗研究表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Starfleet medical research,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.89,0:26:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人的植入器会导致严重的皮肤过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Borg implants can cause severe skin irritations.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.06,0:26:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你想来点止痛剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd like an analgesic cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.11,0:26:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.19,0:26:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这一层 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get off this deck. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.13,0:27:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人首先会在工程部建立一个中心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}First thing they'll do in Engineering is establish a collective,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.51,0:27:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来控制那些个体\N{\fnArial\fs30}a central point from which they can control the hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.17,0:27:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 如果我们在工程室使用粒子武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is, if we begin firing particle weapons in Engineering,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.51,0:27:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可能会打中曲翘系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a risk that we may hit the warp core.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.52,0:27:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们应该先击破其中一个等离子冷却箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe our goal should be to puncture one of the plasma coolant tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.85,0:27:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 数据？- 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Data? - Excellent idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.65,0:27:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机体一碰到等离子冷却剂就会溶解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma coolant will liquefy organic material on contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.90,0:27:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可博格人不完全是有机体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Borg are not entirely organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.24,0:27:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他们有一半是电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}True, but like all cybernetic life-forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.49,0:27:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是没有了有机体他们就无法生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}they cannot survive without their organic components.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.70,0:27:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经下令所有的武器轮换使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have ordered all weapons to be set on a rotating modulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人很快就会适应 我们最多只能开12枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg will adapt quickly. We will be able to fire 12 shots at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.21,0:27:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:27:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能会碰到已经被同化的企业号船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may encounter Enterprise crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.92,0:28:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}who've already been assimilated. Don't hesitate to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这对他们是解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, you'll be doing them a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.31,0:28:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.47,0:28:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安娜！迪安娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna! Deanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.30,0:28:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！别关掉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! Don't turn off the…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.10,0:28:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.94,0:28:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫他关掉我的音乐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who told him he could turn off my music?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.36,0:29:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,维尔·瑞克 泽弗兰·科克伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Riker, Zefram Cochrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.99,0:29:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是你朋友？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he a friend of yours? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.78,0:29:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你丈夫？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Husband? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.33,0:29:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.83,0:29:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个 迪娜… - 迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, this, Deena… - Deanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.59,0:29:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个才是好货色 - 科克伦博士…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is the good stuff. - Dr. Cochrane…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬凤凰号 祝它入土为安\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Phoenix, may she rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.65,0:29:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这酒不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that wasn't so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.53,0:29:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,维尔 我们应该告诉他真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, I think we have to tell him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.87,0:29:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果说出来 那时间顺序… - 时间顺序？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If we tell the truth, the timeline… - Timeline?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.24,0:29:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间讨论时间 我们没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no time to argue about time. We don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.34,0:30:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说什么了？- 你醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was I saying? - You're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.59,0:30:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你醉了！- 不 你醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am not! - Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.38,0:30:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着如果我不陪他喝酒他根本就不理我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he wouldn't even talk to me unless I had a drink with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.22,0:30:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝了三杯龙舌兰酒才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it took three shots of something called tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是我们要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to find out he was the one we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.81,0:30:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又花了20分钟才摆脱了他的毛手毛脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've spent the last 20 minutes trying to keep his hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.19,0:30:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别来评判我的什么谈判技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't go criticizing my counseling technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.78,0:30:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.45,0:30:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是原始文明？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a primitive culture?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.91,0:30:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是想入乡随俗 - 你做到了 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just trying to blend in. - You're blended, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.37,0:30:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他说了我们编的故事 可是他根本不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already told him our cover story. He didn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.08,0:30:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.46,0:30:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们告诉他 他能接受吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if we tell him the truth, do you think he'll be able to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.63,0:30:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是在询问我这个飞船顾问的专业意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're looking for my professional opinion as ship's counselor,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.39,0:30:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个疯子 - 我一定会写进日志的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- he's nuts. - I'll be sure to note that in my log.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.69,0:32:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我相信我感觉到了焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I believe I am feeling anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.19,0:32:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种很奇怪的感觉 让我心烦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is an intriguing sensation. A most distracting…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.36,0:32:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 这对你来说肯定很新奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, I'm sure it's a fascinating experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.66,0:32:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我建议你应该把情绪芯片关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but perhaps you should deactivate your emotion chip for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.95,0:32:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.83,0:32:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 有时候我真的很羡慕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, there are times that I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.52,0:33:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.10,0:33:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 医生 你没事吧？- 没事 不过有人受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doctor, are you all right? - Yes, but we have wounded here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.15,0:33:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛佩兹 带他们回14层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lopez, get these people back to Deck 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个平民 一个21世纪的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a civilian, a woman from the 21st century.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.07,0:33:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走散了 - 我们会找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got separated. - We will watch for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.07,0:33:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫 她不清楚状况 尽量找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worf, she has no idea what's going on. Try to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.68,0:33:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不认为我们是威胁 就不会离我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll ignore us till they consider us a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.06,0:34:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,手动开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}The manual release.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.82,0:34:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫 守住这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, hold this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.70,0:34:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,手动开关启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manual release is online.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.59,0:34:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该敲敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should just knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.09,0:34:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.56,0:35:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,死光枪准备！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready phasers!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.87,0:35:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.51,0:35:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 他们已经适应了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, they've adapted!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.42,0:36:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤回15层 别让他们碰到你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regroup on Deck 15. Don't let them touch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.01,0:36:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长！- 数据！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain! - Data!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.58,0:36:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.58,0:36:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.42,0:36:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.65,0:37:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你！你怎么会… - 后退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You! How the hell did you… - Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.82,0:37:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静点！- 闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down! - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.03,0:37:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我叫吉恩·卢克·皮卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - My name is Jean-Luc Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.74,0:37:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！你们是什么人？什么组织的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Who are you with? What faction?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.45,0:37:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是东联的人 听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a member of the Eastern Coalition. Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.95,0:37:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.20,0:37:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们是什么人 带我离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who you're with. Get me the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.50,0:37:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.67,0:37:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能不太容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}That isn't going to be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.08,0:37:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好想个办法出来 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you better find a way to make it easy, soldier,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.96,0:37:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我可就开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm gonna start pushing buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.30,0:37:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 慢点走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow me. - Slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.89,0:38:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your efforts to break the encryption codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.64,0:38:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是无法破解这些密码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}will not be successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.77,0:38:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也没法把我同化成你们那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor will your attempts to assimilate me into your collective.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.23,0:38:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是豪言壮语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave words.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.15,0:38:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你被制造出来之前 上千个世界里的上千个物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard them before, from thousands of species.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.74,0:38:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都跟我说过同样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}across thousands of worlds since long before you were created.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在 他们全都成了博格人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now, they are all Borg.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.45,0:38:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你以前碰到过的生命体不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am unlike any life-form you have encountered before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.12,0:39:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的中枢神经网密码是不能撤除的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The codes stored in my neural net cannot be forcibly removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.04,0:39:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是一个由不完美个体制造出来的不完美个体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are an imperfect being created by an imperfect being.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.34,0:39:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你的弱点只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding your weakness is only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.31,0:39:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看我是不是真搞清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just make sure that I understand you correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.10,0:39:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群电脑生物 从未来穿越时空\N{\fnArial\fs30}A group of cybernetic creatures from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.74,0:39:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,前来征服人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}have traveled back through time to enslave the human race,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.12,0:39:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而你们要阻止他们？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and you're here to stop them? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.66,0:39:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷毙了 你们真英勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot damn. You're heroic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.66,0:39:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会证明给你看 佐迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna prove it to you. Geordi!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.13,0:39:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在那儿 真漂亮！- 好吧 你自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There she is. Beautiful! - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.01,0:39:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我来看看 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, take a look. - Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.72,0:39:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.64,0:39:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢看西洋镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a good peep show.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.15,0:40:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.11,0:40:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么做到的？- 望远镜是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you do that? - It's your telescope.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.49,0:40:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们的飞船企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our ship, the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.34,0:40:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉莉就在上面？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Lily's up there right now? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.47,0:40:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跟她说话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.51,0:40:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为什么 我们失去了联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost contact with the Enterprise. We don't know why yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.89,0:40:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们要我做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is it you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.31,0:40:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 明天早上按原定计划进行曲翘飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple. Conduct your warp flight tomorrow morning just as you planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.19,0:40:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么明天早上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why tomorrow morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.82,0:40:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为11点钟会有一艘外星飞船经过太阳系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because at 11:00 an alien ship will begin passing through this solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.70,0:40:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星 你是指外星人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alien. You mean extraterrestrials?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.87,0:41:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些坏家伙？- 好家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More bad guys? - Good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.16,0:41:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出来进行勘察 他们 对地球毫无兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on a survey mission. They have no interest in Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.71,0:41:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,太落后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too primitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.67,0:41:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 等他们探测到飞船发出的曲翘信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, tomorrow morning, when they detect the warp signature from your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.84,0:41:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,意识到人类已经知道怎样超光速飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And realize that humans have discovered how to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.34,0:41:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会改变航向\N{\fnArial\fs30}faster than light, they decide to alter their course.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.43,0:41:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这儿跟地球进行第一次接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make first contact with Earth, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿？- 实际上是那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here? - Actually, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.73,0:41:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是人类历史上最关键的时刻之一 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is one of the pivotal moments in human history, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.56,0:41:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会与外星人进行第一次接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to make first contact with an alien race,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.06,0:41:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后 一切都开始改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after you do, everything begins to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.48,0:41:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你的曲翘驱动理论 星际舰队才得以建立\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your theories on warp drive allow fleets of starships to be built,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.24,0:41:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类才开始探索星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mankind to start exploring the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.91,0:41:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它以一种前所未有的办法 将人类统一了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It unites humanity in a way that no one ever thought possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.08,0:41:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们认识到自己在宇宙中并不孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they realize they're not alone in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.37,0:41:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,贫穷 疾病 战争 这在50年后都会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poverty, disease, war, they'll all be gone within the next 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.42,0:41:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果明天11点15分之前 你不进行曲翘飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But unless you make that warp flight tomorrow morning before 11:15,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.63,0:41:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of it will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.26,0:42:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们都是太空人 在太空里漫游\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you people, you're all astronauts on some kind of star trek.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.10,0:42:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着博士 我知道这些对你来说很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Doc, I know this is a lot for you to take in,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.60,0:42:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们没太多时间 我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're running out of time here. We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.15,0:42:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.70,0:42:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何不可？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.68,0:43:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况很糟糕 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty bad, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.35,0:43:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经控制了11层到26层\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like they control Decks 26 up to 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.27,0:43:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是到了11层以后 他们呢就停住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when they took Deck 11, they just stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.69,0:43:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人在几个小时内 同化了大半个船的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg have assimilated more than half the ship in a matter of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.94,0:43:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会停在那儿？11层都有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why stop there? What is on Deck 11?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.82,0:43:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,水载植物 星际地图 偏正盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydroponics, stellar cartography, deflector control.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.62,0:43:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都不是重要系统 - 我想肯定是因为那儿有什么战术优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No vital system. - They would not have stopped there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.83,0:43:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们才会停在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless it gave them a tactical advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.29,0:43:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回岗位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to your checkpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.46,0:43:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每十分钟报告一次 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Send reports every 10 minutes. - Right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.88,0:43:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,医务室里肯定出了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something must've happened in Sickbay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.96,0:43:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉什医生和其他人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are Dr. Crusher and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.38,0:43:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么违背停火协议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you break the cease-fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.01,0:44:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是我们攻击你们！- 那是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We didn't attack you! - Who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.05,0:44:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个新组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.81,0:44:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要阻止你们明天上午的飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wants to prevent your launch tomorrow morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.89,0:44:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们是来帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we are here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.98,0:44:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能很难接受 可现在你已经不在蒙大拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may be difficult for you to accept, but you are not in Montana anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.07,0:44:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在一艘环绕地球飞行的太空船上 高度…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on a ship, a spaceship orbiting the Earth at an altitude of…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.45,0:44:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想帮我 那就带我离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna help me, get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.62,0:44:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.16,0:44:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找出口 这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a way out. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.50,0:44:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.84,0:44:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,澳大利亚 新几内亚 所罗门群岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Australia, New Guinea, the Solomons.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.01,0:44:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙大拿很快就会出现 你可能得屏住呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Montana will be up soon, but you may want to hold your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.10,0:44:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿离地面很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.81,0:44:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在听我说 我不是你的敌人 我能带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen to me. I'm not your enemy, and I can get you home,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.52,0:44:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,可首先你得放下武器 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but first you must put that weapon down and trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.49,0:45:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·卢克·皮卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean-Luc Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.95,0:45:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字 那是我的名字 你的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name. That's my name. What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.62,0:45:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.46,0:45:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.30,0:45:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.72,0:45:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大强度 你一开枪 我就会人间蒸发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximum setting. If you'd fired this, you would've vaporized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.14,0:45:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次用这种枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my first ray gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.54,0:45:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.92,0:46:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,力场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Force field.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.84,0:46:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这种技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen that kind of technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.17,0:46:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为它还没有被发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because it hasn't been invented yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.80,0:46:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.01,0:46:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要解释的太多了 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more I have to tell you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.23,0:46:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.36,0:46:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我就是博格\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I am the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.53,0:46:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是矛盾 博格人只有集体意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a contradiction. The Borg have a collective consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.37,0:46:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no individuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.37,0:46:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既是开端又是终点 既是个人又是集体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the beginning, the end, the one who is many.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.73,0:47:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是博格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.07,0:47:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.99,0:47:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇 是你在控制博格集体吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am curious. Do you control the Borg collective?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.16,0:47:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的地位悬殊并不存在 我就是集体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You imply a disparity where none exists. I am the collective.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.87,0:47:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该换个说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I should rephrase the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.21,0:47:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常想弄清楚你们的组织关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to understand the organizational relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.54,0:47:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他们的领袖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you their leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.46,0:47:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以化乱为治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bring order to chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.47,0:47:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣的回答 虽然很隐晦\N{\fnArial\fs30}An interesting if cryptic response.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.84,0:47:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正处于混乱中 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in chaos, Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.06,0:47:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自身就是矛盾 一个想成为人的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the contradiction. A machine who wishes to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.94,0:47:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你对我这么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you seem to know so much about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.06,0:47:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就该知道我的程序设定就是进化 就是超越自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must be aware that I am programmed to evolve, to better myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.82,0:47:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也正在寻求自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, too, are on a quest to better ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.49,0:47:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,向一种完美的境界进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}evolving toward a state of perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.45,0:47:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说 博格人不是进化 只是征服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, but the Borg do not evolve. They conquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.33,0:48:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的集体把他们吸收进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}By assimilating other beings into our collective,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.79,0:48:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,使他们更加接近完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are bringing them closer to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.30,0:48:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为什么 我觉得你的动机很可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, I question your motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.51,0:48:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为你还没有受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is because you haven't been properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.35,0:48:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,适当的刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}stimulated yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.14,0:48:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你启动了我的情感芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have reactivated my emotion chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.65,0:48:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 你不必害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Don't be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.20,0:48:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.20,0:48:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这是什么吗 数据？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what this is, Data?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.71,0:48:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你是想把有机皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would appear you are attempting to graft organic skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.25,0:48:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,移植到我的骨骼结构上\N{\fnArial\fs30}onto my endoskeletal structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.17,0:48:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此美丽的礼物 却这样冰冷的描述它\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a cold description for such a beautiful gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.32,0:49:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉舒服吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that good for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.99,0:49:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦里有多少行星？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many planets are in this Federation?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.95,0:49:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,8000光年范围内的150颗行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over 150, spread across 8, 000 light-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.58,0:49:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定很少回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not get home much.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.04,0:49:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 这艘船就是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I tend to think of this ship as home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.63,0:49:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是指地球 只要有机会我就会回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's Earth you're talking about, I try to get back whenever I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.84,0:49:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 他们还没有破解密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. They haven't broken the encryption codes yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.89,0:49:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 你说的那些骷髅人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, those bionic zombies you told me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.43,0:49:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博格人 - 博格？很像瑞典名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Borg. - Borg? Sounds Swedish.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.36,0:49:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这艘船有多大？- 共有24层\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How big is this ship? - There are 24 decks,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.99,0:49:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概700米长\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost 700 meters long.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.45,0:49:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花六个月的时间收集到的钛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me six months to scrounge up enough titanium.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.74,0:50:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能建一个4米的座舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to build a four-meter cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.12,0:50:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这得花多少钱啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much did this thing cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.59,0:50:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来的经济有点不太一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The economics of the future are somewhat different.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.59,0:50:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 24世纪已经不存在金钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, money doesn't exist in the 24th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.51,0:50:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有钱？你是说你们没有工资？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No money? You mean you don't get paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.18,0:50:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,获取财富不再是我们的生活劳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The acquisition of wealth is no longer the driving force in our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.81,0:50:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们工作是为了改进自我还有整个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}We work to better ourselves and the rest of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.61,0:50:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 有点像你和科克伦博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we're rather like yourself and Dr. Cochrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.91,0:50:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫！没事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.62,0:50:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 没有其他路了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Is there another way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.30,0:50:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.43,0:51:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不是瑞典人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely not Swedish.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.67,0:51:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么鬼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.65,0:51:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你来件绸缎衣服？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps something in satin?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.74,0:52:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 先生们 我们已经打烊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, gentlemen, but we're closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.29,0:52:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们对着装有严格的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do understand we have a strict dress code,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.25,0:52:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不马上离开我就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you boys don't leave right now, I'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.88,0:52:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找大鼻子尼基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Nicky the Nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,大鼻子？他好几个月没来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nose? He hasn't been here in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.26,0:52:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不是这一章\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the wrong chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.39,0:52:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑！快给我进入第13章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer! Begin chapter 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.57,0:52:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,装作很开心的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and look as if you're having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.04,0:52:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 看着我！表现的自然一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, look at me! Try to act naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.42,0:53:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.44,0:53:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,露碧 现在不太方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby, this is not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.11,0:53:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是不太方便 对吧 迪克斯？总是有借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never the time for us, is it, Dix? Always some excuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.48,0:53:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总是有什么案子 - 我有事找尼基 待会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- some case you're working on. - I have to talk to Nicky. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.49,0:53:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 千万要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but watch your caboose.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.99,0:53:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,甩掉这女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dump the broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.29,0:53:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇 看看这是谁来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well. Look what the cat dragged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.13,0:53:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样 迪克斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's shaking, Dix?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.30,0:53:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老样子 尼克 喝酒玩女人 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual, Nick. Martinis and skirts. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.30,0:53:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我会跟你算这笔账的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm going to take that personal in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.97,0:53:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别见怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.27,0:53:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.34,0:54:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.67,0:54:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.34,0:54:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.72,0:54:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说 这只是全息图吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said this was all just a bunch of holograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.85,0:54:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果是全息图的话… - 我解除了安全协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If it's holograms… - I disengaged the safety protocols.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.89,0:54:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 就算是全息子弹也能杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without them, even a holographic bullet can kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.40,0:54:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么？- 我在找神经处理期\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I'm looking for the neuroprocessor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.52,0:54:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个博格人都有 就像是记忆芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every Borg has one. It's like a memory chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.20,0:54:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面记载着这个博格人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will contain a record of all the instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.70,0:54:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,从集体接到的所有命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Borg has been receiving from the collective.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.99,0:54:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 吉恩·卢克 那是你们的制服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my. Jean-Luc, it's one of your uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.37,0:54:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他是 英吉少尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, this was Ensign Lynch.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.04,0:55:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气够糟的 哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough luck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.88,0:55:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到舰桥去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta get to the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.73,0:55:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.58,0:55:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.08,0:55:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 能看一下这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Would you mind taking a look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.55,0:55:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.59,0:55:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想凭着上学时的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to reconstruct the intermix chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.43,0:55:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,重建混合室\N{\fnArial\fs30}from what I remember in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.59,0:55:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me if I got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.14,0:55:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,学校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}School?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.76,0:55:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在学校学过这个？- 哦 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You learned about this in school? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.98,0:56:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本曲翘设计是大学的必修课程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basic Warp Design is a required course at the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.15,0:56:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一章就叫做「泽弗兰·科克伦」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first chapter is called "Zefram Cochrane".
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.40,0:56:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 看上去没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like you got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.65,0:56:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 我们打算用这个来代替\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander, this is what we're thinking of using.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.70,0:56:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,被损坏的曲翘等离子管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}to replace the damaged warp plasma conduit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.50,0:56:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 瑞吉 非常不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Reg. Yeah, that's good,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.09,0:56:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你需要同毫微聚合物把它加固一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you need to reinforce this copper tubing with a nanopolymer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.05,0:56:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克伦博士 我知道这样很傻 我能跟您握个手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Cochrane, I know this sounds silly, but can I shake your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.81,0:56:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.98,0:56:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟你一起工作真是天大的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you what an honor it is to work with you on this project.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.60,0:56:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞吉 - 我从来没有想过能跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reg. - I never imagined that I'd be meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.10,0:56:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曲翘推进器的发明人 我… - 瑞吉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the man who invented warp drive. I… - Reg!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.32,0:56:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 嗯 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.24,0:57:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们非得这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they have to keep doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.62,0:57:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一点点英雄崇拜 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a little hero worship, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.50,0:57:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句实在话 这也难怪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth, I can't say I blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.21,0:57:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是听着你从前的事迹长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all grew up hearing about what you did here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.59,0:57:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说以后的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what you're about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.34,0:57:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 也许我不该跟您说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I probably shouldn't even tell you this,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.18,0:57:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上的是泽弗兰·科克伦高中\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I went to Zefram Cochrane High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.89,0:57:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.98,0:57:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我真的希望能跟你拍张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I wish I had a picture of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.27,0:57:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 哦 告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Well, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.44,0:57:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后这儿整个地方都会成为历史的遗迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the future, this whole area becomes an historical monument.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多您站的那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're standing almost on the exact spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.95,0:57:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会竖起您的雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}where your statue's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.20,0:57:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雕像？- 哦 对！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Statue? - Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.62,0:57:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是用大理石雕的 20米高 你抬头仰望着天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's marble, about 20 meters tall, and you're looking up at the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.46,0:57:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只手向前伸向未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your hand's sort of reaching toward the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.76,0:57:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去放水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.43,0:58:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,放水？什么地方漏水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leak? I'm not detecting any leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.39,0:58:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道24世纪的人就不用撒尿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you people from the 24th century ever pee?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.73,0:58:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,放水！明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leak! I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.90,0:58:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.07,0:58:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.15,0:58:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.29,0:58:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长 - 吉恩·卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. - Jean-Luc.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.83,0:58:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被同化的谣言纯属无中生有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports of my assimilation are greatly exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.63,0:58:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了你的失物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.05,0:58:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是克林冈人 - 沃尔夫 报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am a Klingon. - Mr. Worf, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.93,0:58:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人控制了大半艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg control over half the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.72,0:58:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试着恢复舰桥和武器系统的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have tried to restore power to the Bridge and the weapon systems,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.35,0:58:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是失败了 - 还有一个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but we have been unsuccessful. - We have another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.02,0:58:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在博格人的神经处理器里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've accessed a Borg neuroprocessor,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.06,0:58:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了他们的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've discovered what they're trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.65,0:58:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在把偏转盘改装成为信标发射台\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're transforming the deflector dish into an interplexing beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.20,0:58:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,信标发射台？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interplexing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.28,0:59:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种子空间发射器 如果他们启动了发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a subspace transmitter. If they activate the beacon,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.95,0:59:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就能和这个世纪的博格人取得联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll be able to establish a link with the Borg living in this century.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.12,0:59:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可在21世纪博格人还住在三角洲区\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the 21st century, the Borg are still in the Delta Quadrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.50,0:59:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会派援兵过来攻击人类就会易如反掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll send reinforcements. Humanity will be an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.54,0:59:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击过去 同化未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack the Earth in the past to assimilate the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.13,0:59:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就要在启动发射器前摧毁偏转盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we must destroy the deflector dish before they can activate the beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.59,0:59:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法控制偏转盘或是宇宙渡船…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get to deflector control or a shuttlecraft…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.10,0:59:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫先生你还记得无重力格斗训练吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, do you remember your zero- g combat training?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.48,0:59:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我恶心的想吐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember it made me sick to my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.07,0:59:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么建议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you suggesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.65,0:59:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们应该出去散散步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time that we took a little stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.99,0:59:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 前面有人类生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. There's a humanoid life-sign up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.46,0:59:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,511米远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five hundred eleven meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.01,1:00:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,科克伦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cochrane?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.26,1:00:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.53,1:00:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我调整了激光桥的频率\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've re-modulated the pulse emitters,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.03,1:00:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想 只要开一两枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I do not believe we will get more than one or two shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.36,1:00:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博格人就会完全适应的 - 那我们就得一枪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- before the Borg adapt. - Then we must make every shot count.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.87,1:00:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动磁力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnetize.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.25,1:00:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 千万要小心 迪克斯 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch your caboose, Dix. - I intend to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.61,1:01:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉怎么样 沃尔夫？- 不太好 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you doing, Mr. Worf? - Not well, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.07,1:01:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要看着那些星星 眼睛盯着船身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to look at the stars. Keep your eyes on the hull.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.79,1:01:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.07,1:01:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你是不是通过聚合体神经传输器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, are you using a polymer-based neuro-relay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.70,1:01:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,将有机神经脉冲发送到\N{\fnArial\fs30}to transmit the organic nerve impulses.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.61,1:01:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的正电子网络中央处理器上呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the central processor of my positronic net?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.62,1:01:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is the case,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.08,1:01:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是如何解决有机合成金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}how have you solved the problem of increased signal degradation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.75,1:01:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,固有的信号逐渐减弱这些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}inherent to organo-ynthetic transmission…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.04,1:01:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是这么多话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you always talk this much?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.80,1:02:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是总是 只是经常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not always, but often.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.22,1:02:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么坚持使用这种原始的语言进行交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you insist on utilizing this primitive linguistic communication?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.59,1:02:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机器大脑实在是大才小用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your android brain is capable of so much more.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.97,1:02:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你忘了 我努力的想变的更像人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you forgotten? I am endeavoring to become more human.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.39,1:02:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 我们以前和他们很像 有缺陷 软弱的有机生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human. We used to be exactly like them. Flawed, weak,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.90,1:02:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们在进化时加进了合成物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we evolved to include the synthetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.11,1:02:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这两点结合起来寻求完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we use both to attain perfection.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.78,1:02:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的目标应该和我们是一致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your goal should be the same as ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.79,1:02:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样自认为完美通常是精神错乱的先兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believing oneself to be perfect is often the sign of a delusional mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.67,1:02:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这井底之蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small words from a small being.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.17,1:02:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对自己不明白的事情竟敢妄加评论\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to attack what he doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.34,1:02:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 你对我没有真真的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that you have no real interest in me,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.55,1:02:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你的目的只是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your goal is to obtain the encryption codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.35,1:02:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到企业号的电脑密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the Enterprise computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.51,1:02:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是目的之一 众多目的中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is one of our goals, one of many.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.02,1:03:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此 我愿意帮助你达到你的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in order to reach it, I am willing to help you reach yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.72,1:03:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始弄明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it becoming clear to you yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.84,1:03:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at yourself, standing there,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.80,1:03:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么爱护我送给你的肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}cradling the new flesh that I've given you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.64,1:03:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它对你没有意义 干嘛要保护它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it means nothing to you, why protect it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.90,1:03:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我只是在模仿人类的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am simply imitating the behavior of humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.11,1:03:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是越来越像人类了 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're becoming more human all the time, Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.74,1:03:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在居然还学会了撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're learning how to lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.78,1:03:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程序它不知道该怎么处理这些感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}My programming was not designed to process these sensations.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.70,1:04:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把它当成故障电路给扯下来不就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tear the skin from your limb as you would a defective circuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.00,1:04:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手啊 数据 我不会拦着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Data. We won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.76,1:04:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧 不要被肉体诱惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it. Don't be tempted by flesh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.86,1:04:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体验过肉体上的愉悦感吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you familiar with physical forms of pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.61,1:04:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果 你现在指的是性能力的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are referring to sexuality,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.16,1:04:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fully functional,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.58,1:04:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程序设有多种技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}programmed in multiple techniques.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.92,1:04:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久没有使用这些技巧了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has it been since you've used them?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.38,1:04:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,8年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.68,1:04:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,零7个月16天4分钟22秒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}seven months, 16 days, four minutes, 22…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.68,1:04:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far too long.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.26,1:05:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该多叫点人来 - 来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should bring reinforcements. - There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.01,1:05:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他们在把信标建在粒子发射器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks as if they're building the beacon right on top of the particle emitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.93,1:05:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要所有的收发器杆放置到位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once all the transponder rods are in place,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.18,1:05:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,信标就会被启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}the beacon will be activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.43,1:05:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把死光枪调到最大强度怎么样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we set our phasers to full power, we can…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.77,1:05:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那可能会击中偏转盘 上面全是反质子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. There's a risk that we hit the dish. It's charged with antiprotons.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.15,1:05:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会毁掉半艘船 得想点儿别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could destroy half the ship. We have to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.21,1:06:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.55,1:06:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博士！- 长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doctor! - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.93,1:06:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在找厕所吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still looking for the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.81,1:06:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不要回去 - 听着 博士 没有你我们没法成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not going back. - Look, Doc, we can't do this without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.18,1:06:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管 我不想成为雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. I don't wanna be a statue.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.81,1:06:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博士… - 你们不要过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doctor… - You stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.27,1:06:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间跟他耗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.21,1:06:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他说了雕像的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told him about the statue?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.84,1:06:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想成功 三个磁锁都得打开才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this to work, all three maglocks will have to be released.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.97,1:09:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,电磁压缩器分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnetic constrictors are disengaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.06,1:09:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们适应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've adapted.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.83,1:10:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 45秒后还原\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Decompression in 45 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.48,1:10:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hawk!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.81,1:13:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的计划有变 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had a change of plans, Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.45,1:13:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,同化这一枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assimilate this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.02,1:14:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个小时 你感觉怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only got an hour to go, Doc. How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.60,1:14:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,头疼的要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a four-alarm hangover,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.31,1:14:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么因为威士忌 要么因为你那枪 要么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}either from the whiskey or your laser beam, or both,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.90,1:14:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm ready to make history.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.61,1:14:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特洛伊呼叫瑞克中校 - 请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Troi to Commander Riker. - Riker here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.41,1:14:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们准备大开发射门 - 打开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're ready to open the launch door. - Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.68,1:14:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.60,1:14:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 24世纪没有月亮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you don't have a moon in the 24th century?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.22,1:14:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有 不过看上去很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure we do. It just looks a lot different.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.48,1:14:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时月亮上住了5000万人口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are 50 million people living on the moon in my time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.52,1:14:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天晴时能看见 蒂古市 新柏林甚至还有阿姆斯特朗湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see Tycho City, New Berlin, even Lake Armstrong on a day like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.11,1:14:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道吗 博士… - 拜托！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you know, Doctor… - Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.15,1:14:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我这都归功于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me it's all thanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.91,1:15:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽弗兰·科克伦的丰功伟绩我已经听够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard enough about the great Zefram Cochrane.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.99,1:15:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你们的历史是谁编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who writes your history books.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.37,1:15:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的历史是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or where you get your information from,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.20,1:15:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你们的人对我的看法太好笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you people got some pretty funny ideas about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.88,1:15:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都把我看成一种圣人或思想家什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all look at me as if I'm some kind of saint or visionary or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.55,1:15:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为你是圣人 博士 但你确实很有理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're a saint, Doc, but you did have a vision.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船就是证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're sitting in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.47,1:15:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我的理想是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know what my vision is?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.35,1:15:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,美元 是钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dollar signs. Money.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.60,1:15:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我造这艘船不是为了开创人类的新时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't build this ship to usher in a new era for humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.82,1:15:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我想上天？我甚至都不喜欢飞！我甚至都坐火车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I want to go to the stars? I don't even like to fly! I take trains!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.53,1:15:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我造这艘飞船是为了退休以后能去热带岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built this ship so that I could retire to some tropical island.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.79,1:15:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,岛上全是裸体女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}filled with naked women.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.58,1:15:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是泽弗兰·科克伦 这才是他的理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Zefram Cochrane. That's his vision.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.92,1:15:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说个没完的这家伙 这个历史人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This other guy you keep talking about, this historical figure,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.26,1:15:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never met him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.55,1:16:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后大概也见不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine I ever will.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.39,1:16:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人曾今说过「不求立大功 但求尽几责」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone once said, "Don't try to be a great man. Just be a man, "
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.10,1:16:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「成败历史自有定论」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and let history make its own judgments."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.48,1:16:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠冕堂皇的废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's rhetorical nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.36,1:16:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁说的？- 你说的 十年后说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who said that? - You did, 10 years from now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.24,1:16:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有58分钟 博士 你最好开始进行检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got 58 minutes, Doc. You better get on that checklist.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.33,1:16:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人又行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the move again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.91,1:16:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们刚刚占领了我们三个防御点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg just overran three of our defense checkpoints.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.50,1:16:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,占领了5层和6层\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've taken over Decks 5 and 6.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.58,1:16:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经适应了我们所有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've adapted to every modulation of our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.46,1:16:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就像对空气开枪一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we're shooting blanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.09,1:16:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在想办法改进武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to work on finding another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.50,1:16:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,增加杀伤力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to modify our weapons so they'll be more effective.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.42,1:16:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住让你的人坚守阵地\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, tell your men to stand their ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.76,1:16:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官… - 必要的时候就进行肉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir… - Fight hand-to-hand if they have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.18,1:16:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.19,1:16:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 船长 武器已经失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Captain, our weapons are useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.86,1:16:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须启动自动摧毁程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must activate the auto- destruct sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.94,1:16:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用逃生舱撤离飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}and use the escape pods to evacuate the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.15,1:17:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.78,1:17:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·卢克 毁掉这艘船等于摧毁博格人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean-Luc, if we destroy the ship, we destroy the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.32,1:17:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要战斗到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna stay and fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.91,1:17:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们已经失去了企业号 我们不应该无谓牺牲了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we have lost the Enterprise. We should not sacrifice…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.95,1:17:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有失去企业号 沃尔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have not lost the Enterprise, Mr. Worf.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.83,1:17:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会让博格人你得到企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not going to lose the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.54,1:17:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to the Borg, not while I'm in command.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.83,1:17:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是命令 - 我必须反对这种决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have your orders. - I must object to this course of action.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.75,1:17:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们应该… - 你的意见我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is… - The objection is noted.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.05,1:17:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.51,1:17:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你是在让你跟博格人的亲身经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you are allowing your personal experience with the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.84,1:17:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,影响你的判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to influence your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.64,1:17:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.18,1:17:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想摧毁飞船然后逃走 你这懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to destroy the ship and run away. You coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.10,1:17:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean-Luc.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.94,1:17:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是别人的话 我会当场杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were any other man, I would kill you where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.78,1:17:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开我的舰桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off my Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.92,1:18:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在怎么办？- 执行他的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what do we do now? - We carry out his orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.55,1:18:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴森 卡普兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dyson, Kaplan,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.21,1:18:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们负责… - 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- start working on a way to modify… - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.30,1:18:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对武器系统进行改进 - 这太愚蠢了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the weapon systems. - This is stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.59,1:18:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能够离开这艘船再摧毁他 为什么不这么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can get off this ship and then blow it up, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.60,1:18:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长下定决心就不可能改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the Captain's made up his mind, the discussion is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.47,1:18:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.44,1:18:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这个混蛋 - 现在不是吵架的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You son of a bitch. - This really isn't the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.86,1:18:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我对24世纪一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I don't know jack about the 24th century,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.78,1:18:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可外面每个人都认为死守这艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}but everybody out there thinks that staying here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.86,1:18:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,形同自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fighting the Borg is suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.49,1:18:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是不敢进来跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just afraid to come in here and say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.32,1:18:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员们习惯服从我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crew is accustomed to following my orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.78,1:18:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能只是习惯于你的合理命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably accustomed to your orders making sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.29,1:18:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不如我了解博格人\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them understand the Borg as I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.79,1:18:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one does.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.29,1:18:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.84,1:18:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.51,1:18:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年前 他们把我同化进了他们的集体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six years ago, they assimilated me into their collective.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.10,1:18:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全身都植入了他们的自动化装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had their cybernetic devices implanted throughout my body.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.35,1:19:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和集体相连 所有的个性都被抹去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was linked to the hive mind, every trace of individuality erased.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.98,1:19:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成了他们一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.90,1:19:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你应该明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can imagine, my dear,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.24,1:19:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能够知道博格人的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a somewhat unique perspective on the Borg,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.62,1:19:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么对付他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know how to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.83,1:19:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意 我还有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you will excuse me, I have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.04,1:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.46,1:19:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,多简单啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.42,1:19:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格人伤害了你 现在你要报复回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg hurt you, and now you're going to hurt them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.76,1:19:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的年代 我们不谈报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my century, we don't succumb to revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.26,1:19:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的理智比这要先进的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a more evolved sensibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.43,1:19:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说！我看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit! I saw the look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.60,1:19:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死博格人时的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you shot those Borg on the Holodeck.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.27,1:19:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几乎是在享受！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were almost enjoying it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.27,1:19:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡言乱语 - 哦 拜托 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How dare you. - Oh, come on, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.61,1:19:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不是第一个从杀人中得到快感的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the first man to get a thrill from murdering someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.86,1:19:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的人我见的多了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it all the time!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.61,1:19:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚出去！- 不然呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out! - Or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.24,1:19:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会杀了我 就像杀了英吉少尉那样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill me like you killed Ensign Lynch?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.91,1:19:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有办法可以救他 - 你连试都没试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There was no way to save him. - You didn't even try.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.79,1:20:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的先进理智去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was your evolved sensibility then?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.29,1:20:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没时间跟你吵 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have time for this. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.79,1:20:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不想打扰你追捕猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't mean to interrupt your little quest.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.34,1:20:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚哈船长必须捕捉他的鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Ahab has to go hunt his whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.68,1:20:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.10,1:20:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们24世纪有书吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have books in the 24th century?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.39,1:20:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是为了报复 - 撒谎！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is not about revenge. - Liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.06,1:20:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了拯救人类的未来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about saving the future of humanity!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.15,1:20:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉恩·卢克 炸掉这艘船！- 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jean-Luc, blow up the damn ship! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.28,1:20:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.58,1:20:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会牺牲企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not sacrifice the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.21,1:20:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经做了太多的妥协 太多的让步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've made too many compromises already, too many retreats.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.38,1:20:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们入侵太空 我们退让了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They invade our space and we fall back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.34,1:20:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们同化整个世界 我们也退让了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They assimilate entire worlds and we fall back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.56,1:20:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.93,1:21:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后的底线 绝不再退半步！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The line must be drawn here. This far, no further!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.11,1:21:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该付出他们该付的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will make them pay for what they've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.47,1:21:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打坏了你的小船\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke your little ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.32,1:21:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 亚哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around, Ahab.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.78,1:21:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他们整个种族对鲸鱼的仇恨」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And he piled upon the whale's white hump"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.32,1:22:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「都堆积在鲸鱼的背脊上」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the sum of all the rage and hate felt by his whole race"
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.33,1:22:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果他的胸膛是大炮 他会用心脏做弹药」.\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If his chest had been a cannon, he would have shot his heart upon it".
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.42,1:22:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.67,1:22:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,白鲸记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moby-Dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.68,1:22:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我从没看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I never read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.52,1:22:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚哈花了好几年时间去追捕那头使他残废的鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahab spent years hunting the white whale that crippled him,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.69,1:22:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}a quest for vengeance,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.78,1:22:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是到了最后 报复却使他人船俱毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in the end, it destroyed him and his ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.54,1:22:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不懂什么时候该放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess he didn't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.19,1:23:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备撤离企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to evacuate the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.42,1:23:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ATR 装置？- 启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ATR setting? - Active.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.51,1:23:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主线路？- 就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Main bus? - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.43,1:23:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动点火前程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiate pre-ignition sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.81,1:23:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始自动摧毁程序 授权 皮卡特4-7-α-T\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin auto-destruct sequence. Authorization, Picard 4-7-alpha-tango.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.60,1:23:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑 贝弗利 克拉什中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, Commander Beverly Crusher.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.81,1:23:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认自动摧毁程序 授权 克拉什2-2-β-c\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm auto-destruct sequence. Authorization, Crusher 2-2-beta-charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.15,1:23:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑 沃尔夫少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, Lieutenant Commander Worf.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.78,1:24:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认自动摧毁程序 授权 沃尔夫3-7-γ-e\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm auto-destruct sequence. Authorization, Worf 3-7-gamma-echo.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.32,1:24:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,认可指挥授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command authorization accepted.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.45,1:24:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待最终密码 开始自动摧毁程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awaiting final code to begin auto-destruct sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.54,1:24:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是船长 吉恩·卢克·皮卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Captain Jean-Luc Picard.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.33,1:24:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动摧毁程序α-1 十五分钟 无声倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destruct sequence alpha-one. Fifteen minutes, silent countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.00,1:24:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enable.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.72,1:24:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,15分钟后自动摧毁 不再有进一步的提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Self-destruct in 15 minutes. There will be no further audio warnings.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.56,1:24:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业E号结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for the Enterprise-E.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.31,1:24:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间太短了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We barely knew her.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.14,1:24:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还会再造一艘吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think they'll build another one?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.31,1:24:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有很多字母可用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty of letters left in the alphabet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.57,1:24:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔夫先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.99,1:24:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对先前对你说过的一些话表示非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret some of the things I said to you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.45,1:24:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.66,1:24:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.21,1:24:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我见过的最勇敢的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're the bravest man I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.67,1:24:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.34,1:25:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉维特岛上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you on Gravett Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.70,1:25:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.83,1:25:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.09,1:25:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制台呼叫凤凰号 最后检查已经完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control to Phoenix. Final launch sequence checks are complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.80,1:25:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.88,1:25:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好创造历史了吗？- 早就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody ready to make some history? - Always am.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.80,1:25:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我好想忘了什么东西 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I forgot something. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.55,1:25:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可能没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It's probably nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.10,1:25:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始点火程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin ignition sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.40,1:26:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 20 19… - 哦 天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 20, 19… - Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.23,1:26:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想起来了！- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I remember! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.90,1:26:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪呢？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.74,1:26:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有它我没法发射！- 佐迪 我们得放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't lift off without it! - Geordi, we've got to abort.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.45,1:26:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不 等等 我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, wait, I found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.96,1:26:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱摇滚乐！- 7 6…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's rock and roll! - 7, 6…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.74,1:26:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能小点声吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that down a little?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.03,1:26:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！第二个进气阀亮着红灯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! We've got a red light on the second intake valve.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.29,1:27:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管它 没事儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignore it. We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.26,1:27:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我指挥 进行第一阶段关闭和脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare first stage shutdown and separation on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.64,1:27:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}mark!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.66,1:27:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 启动曲翘推进器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's bring the warp core online.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.21,1:27:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,更美的在后面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't seen nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.67,1:27:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果看到瑞克中校他们 把这个给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see Commander Riker or any of my crew, give them this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.51,1:27:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.17,1:27:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,命令他们在北美找一个安静的角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orders to find a quiet corner of North America.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.68,1:27:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要干扰历史的进程\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stay out of history's way.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.18,1:27:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.35,1:27:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}To both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.85,1:28:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你不走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not leaving, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.78,1:28:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉 我被关在博格人的船上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lily, when I was held captive on the Borg ship,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.69,1:28:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船员们冒着危险去救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}my crew risked everything to save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.70,1:28:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.78,1:28:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一名船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.16,1:28:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,被困在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}still on this ship,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.87,1:28:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I owe him the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.54,1:28:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找你的朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and find your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.34,1:29:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 卢丘塔斯？这一切不熟悉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, Locutus? Isn't this familiar?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.47,1:30:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机意识是这么脆弱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organic minds are such fragile things.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.98,1:30:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么快就把我忘了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you forget me so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.81,1:30:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经那么亲近 你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were very close, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.48,1:30:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仍然能听到我的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can still hear our song.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.65,1:30:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.74,1:30:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,记起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.99,1:30:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.46,1:30:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.58,1:30:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,和船上的博格人都被炸毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the Borg on it were destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.92,1:30:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的想法是这么的三维\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think in such three-dimensional terms.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.55,1:30:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你变的很渺小\N{\fnArial\fs30}How small you've become.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.18,1:30:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据就能明白我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data understands me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.68,1:30:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 数据？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you, Data?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.60,1:30:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.19,1:30:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直想要的血肉之躯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given him what he always wanted, flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.57,1:30:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他走 他不是你要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go. He's not the one you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.07,1:30:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在向我献身吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you offering yourself to us?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.99,1:31:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你献身？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offering myself?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.21,1:31:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.96,1:31:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你同化了我还觉得不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't enough that you assimilate me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.21,1:31:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把自己完全献给博格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to give myself freely to the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.09,1:31:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 你太高估自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To you. - You flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.55,1:31:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同化过几百万个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've overseen the assimilation of countless millions.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.64,1:31:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没有什么不同 - 你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were no different. - You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.68,1:31:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的不仅仅是一个博格雄蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted more than just another Borg drone.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.35,1:31:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的是一个有自己意识的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted a human being with a mind of his own.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.06,1:31:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能在人类和博格人之间架起桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who could bridge the gulf between humanity and the Borg.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.57,1:31:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的是搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted a counterpart.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.57,1:31:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I resisted.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.45,1:31:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我反抗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fought you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.36,1:31:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至都不知道自己拒绝了多好的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't begin to imagine the life you denied yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.58,1:31:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.46,1:31:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢丘塔斯还可以在你身边 就像你想要的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locutus could still be with you, just in the way you wanted,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.72,1:31:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个对等体\N{\fnArial\fs30}an equal.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.93,1:32:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了数据 我就会自愿的站在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Data go, and I will take my place at your side,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.14,1:32:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不做任何反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}willingly, without any resistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.44,1:32:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么高尚的情操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a noble creature,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.98,1:32:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就缺乏这种品质\N{\fnArial\fs30}a quality we sometimes lack.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.23,1:32:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会吸收你的优点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will add your distinctiveness to our own.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.66,1:32:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你回来 卢丘塔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Locutus.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.21,1:32:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 你可以走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, you are free to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.25,1:32:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 数据 快走 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Data, go. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.97,1:32:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not wish to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.97,1:32:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都看到了 我已经找到了一个对等体\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, I have already found an equal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.06,1:32:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 关闭飞船的自动摧毁程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, deactivate the self- destruct sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.73,1:32:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 不 不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, no. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.82,1:32:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.32,1:33:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动摧毁程序关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auto-destruct sequence deactivated.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.74,1:33:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入密码 把电脑的控制权给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now enter the encryption codes and give me computer control.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.46,1:33:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.04,1:33:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.76,1:33:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会是匹出色的种马\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will make an excellent drone.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.57,1:33:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等离子喷射器已经启动 一切看上去都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma injectors are online. Everything's looking good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.53,1:33:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.03,1:33:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be out there right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.95,1:33:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想引起他们的注意 5分钟内\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better break the warp barrier in the next five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.33,1:33:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得进入曲翘速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're gonna get their attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.54,1:33:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经加足马力 准备就绪 - 开始吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nacelles are charged and ready. - Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.92,1:33:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.55,1:34:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲翘场情况良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp field is looking good.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.22,1:34:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船的结构很稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Structural integrity is holding.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.39,1:34:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 速度？- 每秒两万公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Speed? - 20, 000 kilometers per second.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.15,1:34:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天爷啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.07,1:34:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 博士 他们肯定是来送行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Doctor. I'm sure they're just here to give us a send-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.41,1:34:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经启动了外部传感器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am bringing the external sensors online.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.59,1:34:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,30秒后进入曲翘速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty seconds to warp threshold.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.23,1:34:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在接近光速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approaching light-speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.27,1:35:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是临界速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at critical velocity.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.77,1:35:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 量子鱼雷已经锁定目标 - 摧毁他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quantum torpedoes locked. - Destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.83,1:35:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着 你的未来完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your future's end.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.56,1:35:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.14,1:35:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有未来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.90,1:37:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should be enough. Throttle back. Take us out of warp.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.41,1:37:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是地球？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Earth?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.58,1:37:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.50,1:37:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么小\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so small.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.92,1:37:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就会变得很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about to get a whole lot bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.50,1:38:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.21,1:38:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.26,1:38:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.22,1:39:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我看上去一定非常的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would imagine I look worse than I…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.89,1:39:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.94,1:39:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.78,1:39:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然因为她的死而感到有些难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of me is sorry she is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.58,1:39:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was unique.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.70,1:39:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让我和人类有了从未有过的接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}She brought me closer to humanity than I ever thought possible,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.96,1:39:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for a time,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.67,1:39:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的被她所打动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was tempted by her offer.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.84,1:39:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿是多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long a time?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.14,1:39:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共是0.68秒 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero-point-six-eight seconds, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.27,1:39:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可对机器人来说 这已经接近于永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}For an android, that is nearly an eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.41,1:40:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长日志 2063年4月5日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain's Log, April 5th, 2063.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.45,1:40:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰号的航空旅行成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The voyage of the Phoenix was a success,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.00,1:40:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星飞船捕捉到了曲翘信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alien ship detected the warp signature.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.05,1:40:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在前来做历史性的会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is on its way to rendezvous with history.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.75,1:41:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.08,1:41:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真的来自另一个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're really from another world.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.33,1:41:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想见见曲翘飞船的驾驶员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're going to want to meet the man who flew that warp ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.10,1:42:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝健康长寿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live long and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.58,1:42:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.59,1:43:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我们该悄然隐退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time we made a discreet exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.05,1:43:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克呼叫企业号 准备传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riker to Enterprise, stand by to beam us up.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.48,1:43:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要走了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta go?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.27,1:43:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我羡慕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I envy you,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.61,1:43:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world you're going to.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.61,1:43:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也羡慕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I envy you,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.07,1:43:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,羡慕你率先开拓新领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking these first steps into a new frontier.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.58,1:43:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想你的 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall miss you, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.76,1:43:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡特呼叫企业号 传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picard to Enterprise. Energize.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.27,1:44:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报告情况 - 月亮的引力场掩盖了我们的曲翘信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Report. - The moon's gravitational field.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.90,1:44:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔坎人没发现我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}obscured our warp signature. The Vulcans did not detect us.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.82,1:44:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我重配了曲翘场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I've reconfigured our warp field.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.61,1:44:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来配合博格区的计时读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}to match the chronometric readings of the Borg sphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.49,1:44:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 重新造出时间旋涡 中校 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Recreate the vortex, Commander. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.49,1:44:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,各层准备完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All decks report ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.24,1:44:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舵手正在待命 - 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Helm standing by. - Mr. Data,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.16,1:44:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定回24世纪的航线\N{\fnArial\fs30}lay in a course for the 24th century.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.83,1:44:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们的未来正在等待着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect our future is there waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.13,1:44:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,航线设定完毕 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course laid in, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.34,1:44:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it so.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.81,1:44:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我给你放段好听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I give you some music.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.29,1:45:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！别走！你听听 不错的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no! Don't go! Enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.70,1:45:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳起来啊 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's dance, guys.
